Write voiceover scripts: "{{ video_title }}"

<arc>
{{ narrative_arc }}
</arc>

<segments>
{% for segment in segments %}
Segment {{ loop.index }}: {{ segment.title }}
- Duration: {{ segment.duration }}s (~{{ (segment.duration * 2.5) | round(0) | int }} words)
- Purpose: {{ segment.purpose }}
- Hook: {{ segment.narrative_hook }}
{% if loop.index > 1 %}- From previous: {{ segment.transition_from_previous }}{% endif %}
- Key points: {{ segment.key_points | join(', ') }}
- Content: {{ segment.content }}
{% if loop.index < segments|length %}- To next: {{ segment.transition_to_next }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
</segments>

<requirements>
- Separate script per segment in order
- Self-contained yet connected via transitions
- Honor hook, purpose, transitions
- Target: duration × 2.5 words
- Natural, energetic speech
- Creative: vivid metaphors, compelling analogies, memorable phrasing
- Expressive: varied structure, strong verbs, rhythm
- Engaging: hooks, tension, insights
- JSON: title + segments array (segment_number, script)
</requirements>
